  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "legacy",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Plugins",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>ATAK's features can be extended with various Plugins.</li>\n<li>Deploy App's TAK will automatically serve you set of plugins that you need to Load upon starting up.</li>\n<li>The following actions to installing &#x26; load the plugins <strong>need only to be done once.</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "1. Data Sync - Missing",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>The Data Sync plugin is the most important plugin to load.</li>\n<li>Data Sync Missing from toolbar means that you have to load it.</li>\n<li>To do so, first select the top right <strong>hamburger menu.</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/49e065be1c38ff46.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "2. Data Sync - Tools Menu",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select <strong>Plugins.</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/959670dee9b0050b.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "3. Data Sync - TAK Package Mgmt",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tap <strong>Data Sync 'Not Installed'</strong> to open the installation dialog.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/73ffe372020899e4.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "4. Data Sync - Install Product Plugin",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select <strong>OK</strong> on Installing 'Product Data Sync.'</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/86500dea7e683f75.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "5. Data Sync - Permission to install",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>The dialog asks, whether you want to install this app.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Install.</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3aa2c36d7d52db85.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "6. Data Sync - Permission missing 1",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>This and the following task is only required if you get a notification that installing from unknown apps from ATAK isn't allowed.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Select <strong>Settings.</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8f122306b7c7489f.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "7. Data Sync - Permission missing 2",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tap <strong>Install unknown apps.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Allow</strong> permissions for ATAK.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e9d640992c63039a.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "8. Data Sync - Install",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>The Data Sync plugin installation dialog shows you information about the plugin.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Install</strong> to continue.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/98e4f0bfd6f70f83.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "9. Data Sync - Permission to install",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>The dialog asks, 'Do you want to install this app?'</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Install.</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3aa2c36d7d52db85.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "10. Data Sync - Installed 1",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>The dialog informs you that the plugin has been installed.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Done.</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1ddf34aa91adfc00.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "11. Data Sync - Installed 2",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>From the Plugins menu, check that Data Sync is Installed and Loaded.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/d76d8d18f5129d03.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Load Other Plugins",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<p>Similarily, load other standard plugins:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>OpenTAKICU:</strong> Video streaming georeferenced in TAK.</li>\n<li><strong>TAK VNS:</strong> Use this instead of Google Maps for routing to destination.</li>\n<li><strong>UAS Tool:</strong>: Install if you need to operate and stream video from drones to your team.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
